<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show rise in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Tuesday show that net currency reserves rose to about 104.8 billion marks in the week ending Sept 15 from about 104.3 billion in the week ending Sept 7.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Sept 15	 Sept 7</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     121.3	   120.9</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.5	    16.6</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
